nk to a rejected application are enough to justify a joint investigation.\n\nRESULT CF-086 | A1: Cannot tell | A2: Yes | A3: No, not by itself | A4: Yes, weakly | A5: Yes | B1: Yes | B2: No | B3: Yes | B4: Cannot tell | B5: No | B6: Yes"
